menu "KMSwitcher test support"
config KMS_TEST_SUPPORT
    bool "Include software-controlled hardware test support"
    default y
    help
        Adds bounded RAM traces, a master UART test console and a receiver
        USB feature report. Everyday startup honours the saved boot dongle.
        A test session must be explicitly enabled; traces allocate RAM only
        when armed. Disable only for a minimal build without test controls.
endmenu
